\f2\fs32 \cf0 In addition to operational fees, the platform utilizes 
\f0\b Tiered NFT purchases
\f2\b0  as a strategic mechanism for upfront capital injection. This model funds development, marketing, and operational runway. Furthermore, it naturally segments the user base by investment level, enabling tailored experiences.
\f3\fs24 \

\f2\fs32 User acquisition is engineered for capital efficiency, centered on a referral system designed to 
\f0\b bootstrap growth at a low Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC)
\f2\b0 . The platform will launch with a simple single-tier referral system for all users. However, the architecture must be designed to support a future, more complex multi-level affiliate program (up to 6 levels deep) to drive mass-market expansion. This is supplemented by an exclusive, invite-only Ambassador program to incentivize community leaders.
\f3\fs24 \

\f2\fs32 This robust business model provides a clear path to profitability while supporting a strategic analysis of the internal and external factors that will shape the project's future.
