\cf0 The withdrawal logic is designed for simplicity. A 
\f0\b 24-hour fee-free withdrawal window
\f2\b0  is available on the 1st of each month. Withdrawals at any other time are subject to a 1% exit fee. All requests are submitted via a ticket system and processed manually. Crucially, users can only withdraw USDC that is currently idle in the platform's wallet. 
\f0\b Funds actively staked in a money market protocol or locked in a liquidity pool cannot be withdrawn.
